From 1284edaecba5ef6cb6969b6847642a627fa22b4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:53:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Use Google Gemini instead of Claude for the AI layer

- src/ai.js calls the Gemini generateContent REST API (JSON mode)
- GEMINI_API_KEY (or GOOGLE_API_KEY) enables it; default model gemini-3.8-flash,
  overridable with TRUST_AI_MODEL; keyword fallback unchanged
- UI, server comments and README updated

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E34p4tMnXfkHjdXtc98yJS
